{title: Hum Aapke Hai Koun}
{artist: S P Balsubramaniam Lata Mangeshkar}
{key: Dm}

{c: Verse 1}
[Dm]Bechain [G]hai, [Dm]meri nazar,
[Dm]Hai [G]pyar ka, [Dm]kaisa asar,
[F]Na chup raho, [D]itna kaho,
[F]Hum [A]aapke, aapke [Dm]hain kaun
[F]Hum [A]aapke, aapke [Dm]hain kaun
[Dm]Khud [G]ko sanam, [Dm]roka bada,
[Dm]Aakhir [G]mujhe, [Dm]kehna pada,
[F]Khwaabon mein tum, [D]aate ho kyon
[F]Hum [A]aapke, aapke [Dm]hain kaun
[F]Hum [A]aapke, aapke [Dm]hain kaun
