[Dm]Hai [G]pyar ka, [Dm]kaisa asar,
[F]Hain hosh gum, [D]poocho na tum,
[F]Hum [A]aapke, aapke [Dm]hain kaun
[F]Hum [A]aapke, aapke [Dm]hain kaun
[Dm]Kaise [G]kahun, dil [Dm]ki lagi?
[Dm]Chehra [G]mera, padh [Dm]lo kabhi.
[F]Yeh sharm ki, [D]surkhi kahe,
[F]Hum [A]aapke, aapke [Dm]hain kaun
